sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Person
    participant B as Browsy
    participant A as Authy
    participant T as Telegram
    participant N as MyNet
    participant F as MyFamily
    participant R as Peer
    participant W as Wizy
    participant S as Nety
    P->>B: open Browsy
    B->>A: authenticate Telegram
    A->>T: authenticate
    T-->>A: presence + id
    Note over A: L2 presence · no @handle public
    T->>N: enable MyNet
    N->>F: simplified contact
    F-->>N: relation + traits + affinity
    N->>B: open MyNet record
    F->>B: save class Local
    B->>B: sign grant · paths · expiry
    R->>B: pull allowed deltas
    B-->>R: encrypted projection
    R->>R: verify + decrypt
    Note over R: only granted paths
    R->>W: hand over local view
    W->>W: merge P + Local
    W-->>R: D0/D1 · explanation
    Note over W: local only
    alt publish Social
        P->>A: claim Telegram
        A->>T: nonce + DM
        T-->>A: id == id
        Note over A: L3 verified
        B->>S: public card · consent
        S-->>R: social reads
    else stay local
        B-->>R: Local only
    end
    Note over B,S: P never leaves · Social is separate
